Package: DSBtools
Type: Package
Title: Teaching Tools for Automatic Exploratory Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Saskia", "Otto", email = "saskia.a.otto@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut","cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7780-1322")))
Description: Teaching-oriented tools for exploratory data analysis in
    introductory data science courses. Functions automatically determine the
    scale of measurement (nominal, ordinal, discrete, or continuous) of the
    variables and produce annotated figures and tables: exploring one or two
    variables, checking a data frame for common data-quality pitfalls,
    suggesting a suitable statistical test, and assessing normality. All output
    is available in English and German.
